2025-10-17 13:46:00 [simon@midnightblue] which bits use api calls
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] The only code in the shared tree that actually calls out to an external HTTP API is the
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] handful of `sendRPC()` helpers in dsptool.js (and one tiny helper in dspkernel.js).
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] Everything else is purely client-side; no other file issues `fetch`/`XMLHttpRequest` or opens
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] WebSockets.
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] API-touching spots (all in `/web/nitrojs/dsptool.js` unless noted):
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 1. `refreshSession()` – the very first boot-up ping
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `sendRPC("/api","sys.info", …)`
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 2. Periodic poll while the “online” toggle is on
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `sendRPC("/api","sys.tick", …)` – fires every 20 ms loop while `PollSession == true`
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 3. All the buttons under the “System” bar (Upgrade, Shutdown, Restart, etc.)
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `sendRPC("/api","sys.refresh", …)`
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `sendRPC("/api","sys.shutdown", …)`
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `sendRPC("/api","sys.restart", …)`
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `sendRPC("/api","sys.reset", …)`
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 4. DSP / audio-engine commands
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `sendRPC("/api","dsp.load", …)`
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `sendRPC("/api","dsp.program", …)`
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `sendRPC("/api","dsp.compare", …)`
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `sendRPC("/api","dsp.set", …)`
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 5. Coprocessor & hardware registers
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `sendRPC("/api","copro.reset", …)`
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `sendRPC("/api","copro.run", …)`
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `sendRPC("/api","pmic.read", …)`
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `sendRPC("/api","gpio.registers", …)`
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 6. Bluetooth & NMEA (marine) devices
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `sendRPC("/api","bt.scan", …)`
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `sendRPC("/api","bt.connect", …)`
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `sendRPC("/api","nmea.poll", …)`
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 7. MIDI file fetch (one-shot, user-initiated)
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `fetchMidi()` – issues a normal `XMLHttpRequest` to grab `.mid` files from `/notes/…`
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 8. Redis bridge (in dspkernel.js)
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905]    `sendRPC("/api","redis.run", …)` – only when you click the custom Redis-key buttons
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] That’s the complete list—everything else (Web MIDI, Web Audio, gamepad, sensors, local-storage
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] patches, etc.) runs entirely in the browser and costs you zero API tokens.
2025-10-17 13:46:37 [kimi-k2-0905] 
