2025-10-22 14:37:33 [kimi-k2-0905] - `sloppybot.ts` – a Discord bot that forwards Discord messages into the same pipe and back
2025-10-22 14:37:33 [kimi-k2-0905] - `sloppyhost.ts` – an HTTP file-server / JSON-RPC stub that also spawns the `slophole` worker
