2025-10-28 11:57:03 [claude-haiku-4-5] I'm Claude, an AI assistant made by Anthropic. I aim to be helpful, harmless, and honest in
2025-10-28 11:57:03 [claude-haiku-4-5] conversations.
2025-10-28 11:57:03 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2025-10-28 11:57:03 [claude-haiku-4-5] Claude Haiku 4.5
2025-10-28 11:57:03 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2025-10-28 11:57:03 [claude-haiku-4-5] Haiku is Anthropic's fastest and most compact model in the Claude family. Key characteristics:
2025-10-28 11:57:03 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2025-10-28 11:57:03 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Speed: Optimized for low-latency responses
2025-10-28 11:57:03 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Efficiency: Lower token costs, runs on resource-constrained environments
2025-10-28 11:57:03 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Capability: Handles general tasks well—coding, analysis, creative writing, Q&A
2025-10-28 11:57:03 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Context: 200K token window for processing longer documents
2025-10-28 11:57:03 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Use cases: Real-time applications, high-volume processing, edge deployment
2025-10-28 11:57:03 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2025-10-28 11:57:03 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Trade-offs*: Less capable than Claude 3.5 Sonnet on complex reasoning tasks, but
2025-10-28 11:57:03 [claude-haiku-4-5] excellent value for most practical applications.
2025-10-28 11:57:03 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2025-10-28 11:57:03 [claude-haiku-4-5] It's a solid choice when you need speed and efficiency without sacrificing too much capability.
2025-10-28 11:57:03 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
