2025-10-28 11:59:51 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2025-10-28 11:59:51 [claude-haiku-4-5] • slopfountain.ts* (main application)
2025-10-28 11:59:51 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Comprehensive relay system supporting OpenAI, DeepSeek, Anthropic, Google, Alibaba APIs
2025-10-28 11:59:51 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Tool calling, vision, speech, reasoning budget support
2025-10-28 11:59:51 [claude-haiku-4-5] - History management, file sharing with hash tracking
2025-10-28 11:59:51 [claude-haiku-4-5] - ANSI markdown rendering, raw mode prompt handling
2025-10-28 11:59:51 [claude-haiku-4-5] - ~2500 lines, well-structured despite packed style
2025-10-28 11:59:51 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2025-10-28 11:59:51 [claude-haiku-4-5] • slopprompt.ts* (raw mode stdin)
2025-10-28 11:59:51 [claude-haiku-4-5] - TCP listener for remote connections (port 8081)
2025-10-28 11:59:51 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Grapheme-aware terminal I/O with emoji width handling
2025-10-28 11:59:51 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Shortcode expansion (`:heart:` → ❤️)
2025-10-28 11:59:51 [claude-haiku-4-5] - History navigation, cursor control
2025-10-28 11:59:51 [claude-haiku-4-5] - NDJSON broadcast protocol
